+
+## Routes
+
+- `GET /items`, `GET /items/:id`: items with stock on hand.
+- `GET /batches`, `GET /batches/:id`, `POST /batches/:id/waste`: batches, movements and waste.
+- `POST /orders`, `GET /orders/:id`, `POST /orders/:id/send`, `POST /orders/:id/receive`, `POST /orders/:id/cancel`: purchase orders.
+- `POST /recipes/:id/cook`: cook portions of a recipe.
+- `GET /reports/stock-value`, `GET /reports/waste?from=&to=`, `GET /reports/variance?from=&to=`: stock value, waste and usage variance (`{ itemId, name, unit, theoretical, actual, diff }`).
+- `GET /alerts`: batches expiring soon and items below minimum.
+- `GET /suppliers`, `GET /suppliers/:id/prices?on=`, `POST /prices`, `GET /items/:id/best-price`: suppliers and price lists.
+- `GET /dishes`, `POST /dishes`, `GET /reports/margins`, `GET /recipes/:id/cost`: menu and recipe costing.
+- `GET /forecast/use/:itemId`, `GET /forecast/reorder`: usage and reorder suggestions.
+- `GET /outbox`, `POST /outbox/:id/sent`: notifications waiting to be sent.
+- `POST /import/items`: import items from CSV (`{ added, updated }`).
+- `POST /import/sales`: import till sales from CSV (`ticket,soldAt,dishId,qty` → `{ tickets, dishes }`).
+- `POST /jobs/nightly`: run the nightly checks.
+- `POST /stocktakes`, `POST /stocktakes/:id/counts`, `POST /stocktakes/:id/finish`: stock-takes.
+- `PUT /items/:id/allergens`, `GET /recipes/:id/allergens`, `GET /reports/allergens`: allergens.
+- `POST /temperatures`, `GET /reports/temperatures?day=`: temperature logs.
+- `GET /export/ledger.csv`, `GET /export/stock.csv`: CSV exports.

