+## Sales and variance
+
+- Each imported sale (`ticket,soldAt,dishId,qty`) uses `qty` portions of the
+  dish's recipe at `soldAt`, writing `consume` movements with `ref`
+  `sale:<ticket>`. Tickets already imported are skipped; an invalid row or
+  shortage leaves the store unchanged.
